<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Unitrans half year shr rises, div up.</title>
<headline>Unitrans half year shr rises, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, diluted (cts)    79.7     vs    68.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 18.0     vs    16.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   43.31    vs    33.59</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   52.24    vs    42.82</p>
<p>    Tax			  8.87    vs     8.71</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   20.39    vs    15.29</p>
<p>    Turnover		 412.73    vs   351.93</p>
<p>Div payable: March 27</p>
<p>On register: February 28</p>
<p>Full name: Unitrans Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it expected an acceptable improvement in fully diluted earnings per share for the year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
